cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data package, please cite both the package and the underlying manuscript."
title: "ehrafpunishmentdata: Paragraph-level coded ethnographic data on punishment from 60 societies"
abstract: >-
  Paragraph-level coded ethnographic data on punishment from 60 societies in
  the eHRAF Probability Sample Files (PSF). Eight coders independently rated
  5,478 ethnographic paragraphs, producing 11,893 codings of evidence for
  second-party punishment, third-party punishment, and three subtypes of
  third-party punishment (kin-directed, partner-directed, generalized). Each
  paragraph received at least two independent codings. The package contains
  six data tables: paragraph-level codings, paragraph-level raw text and
  metadata, document-level metadata, society-level covariates including
  resource-use intensification (RI), technological and social differentiation
  (TSD), and the Kinship Intensity Index (KII), and variable loadings for the
  RI and TSD latent factors.
